$ plumber help --help
exit: 0
--- stdout
Help provides help for any command in the application.
Simply type plumber help [path to command] for full details.

Usage:
  plumber help [command] [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for help

Global Flags:
  -v, --verbose   Enable debug logging on stderr (level=debug); replaces the progress bar

